# Kept even though it is a one-off: it is the record of WHICH reviews we
# were licensed to take and which we refused. This repo is public.
!scripts/import-cc-reviews.mjs
# The UI verification harness: a throwaway account + org to look at a signed-in
# screen with. Reads .env.local (ignored) and sweeps after itself.
!scripts/probe-ui.mjs

